    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-3f0af27a-7d17-4fb4-9a70-48f1d6050565" n="1985" facs="#m-238731c2-7902-4a58-9daa-1eeb72b1a8e7" /><div xml:id="m-de8d6248-4640-4138-a72f-c255ebd546f0">
            <lg xml:id="m-142a2f40-1bad-4294-8251-d041e147834f">
              <l xml:id="m-3e3fc926-2baf-4b4f-bbac-fe2fa4b278e2" facs="#m-786ca394-87d3-48bd-baa2-b0e47fbe5ce2" label="ambiguous">1730</l><l xml:id="m-cc0f56f7-c3fc-49ed-b6de-b1c903c21266" facs="#m-8a740ae6-5e94-4da2-9da1-1cf7925803ad" label="ambiguous">November 2.</l><l xml:id="m-a51b32bc-6e4a-44b8-a88d-26ec449dd875" facs="#m-929ad849-fa8c-48be-8876-4e9203ad70cf" label="lyrics-like">V. Requiéscant in pâce. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-eee8cad7-4de4-498c-a86a-5662f38e909a" facs="#m-f8c54f4d-d02f-4cc6-92ca-b4a748fc3148" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine, exáudi oratiónem méam. R. Et clámor méus ad te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-eac88fb0-7668-4d9c-b885-1d04ea4e557f" facs="#m-d5ea224f-b51f-42d8-8d92-9d2e8509eaad" label="lyrics-like">v. Dóminus vobiscum. R. Et cum spiritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-573dd7c7-13b1-4d56-8741-98f444b76197" facs="#m-4ead2fc7-f5fe-4f26-ac62-8d034978fd7c" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-bfb5676b-9d80-4407-9504-5026f6b79671" facs="#m-2a446aa4-730f-4a70-aae7-1353aa38f513" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-a67f4598-32bc-4112-b05c-cbe942f631c4" facs="#m-6a4df250-900a-44a3-9427-a6e1eb8b5ca9" label="lyrics-like">LrIdélium, Deus, ómnium Cóndi-[ semper optavérunt, * piis supplica¬</l><l xml:id="m-37dc61d5-8626-42d8-98e4-9f5adcdd3115" facs="#m-cbb083fd-2b53-4c89-8fd9-40707a43504f" label="lyrics-like">Itor et Redémptor, animábus! tiónibus consequántur : Qui vivis et</l><l xml:id="m-de017b39-dc6f-4455-8ffc-db771cc1da9b" facs="#m-4a80bdb8-f17d-4f59-bade-95a66e541e45" label="lyrics-like">famulórum famularúmque tuárum l regnas cum Deo Patre in unitáte</l><l xml:id="m-1527b384-2fe5-4b86-85a1-6766eb2fb8f2" facs="#m-1532274b-36c0-48bb-abb2-6e7dcfe5fa47" label="lyrics-like">remissiónem cunctórum tribue pec-lSpiritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-35da47dc-3285-4b48-bbef-4cde54cee0f3" facs="#m-df7792d8-4b7d-4fa1-ba0f-9ecf03a6c1a2" label="lyrics-like">catórum : ! ut indulgéntiam, quam l saécula saeculórum. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-16380dec-c9ae-4639-8b8c-5a8a5f02a8e2" facs="#m-8da38d3a-7cc6-40ec-b82b-8ae81fca85c1" label="lyrics-like">V. Réquiem aetérnam dóna éis, Dómine. K. Et lux perpétua lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-62a2abfe-00dd-4186-bb78-b31c80054529" facs="#m-5d6092c8-4e84-4941-a558-16882b044f83" label="lyrics-like">V. Requiéscant in pâce. H. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-acd94eae-15a5-4f18-9acc-b1e15c53845a" facs="#m-9990549d-20a1-40cc-a953-15eb2ca9f6c6" label="text-like">Sext and None end in the same way as the above.</l><l xml:id="m-78ce079d-2219-410a-86cd-0902adb9d59a" facs="#m-5f05b8f1-12f3-4397-b3e4-87bed3a6c77e" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-0410316f-42d4-400b-992d-64d021bac8a5" facs="#m-4cb82b22-3d4a-44df-914d-0c382c8bb4f6" label="lyrics-like">Convérte nos, Déus, salutáris</l><l xml:id="m-d9ded7e4-c795-4d04-915c-2990bb46fa93" facs="#m-57719a2a-38e6-4e41-b176-006b580dde01" label="ambiguous">Psalm 60.</l><l xml:id="m-9284f944-46f1-4d61-8050-8cd371185a05" facs="#m-1a40b367-5b92-4498-b13c-f7111c2d5f78" label="lyrics-like">nóster:*et avérte iram túam a</l><l xml:id="m-313d0df1-573e-4e74-ad06-237b2518ba6f" facs="#m-9f5a4631-fb34-4707-8679-935ab8e439fc" label="lyrics-like">Eus, in adjutórium méum in¬</l><l xml:id="m-91fa9ce6-eaeb-4e2c-8839-a744ed6f867e" facs="#m-85c49cf5-4e1d-43ca-a875-8c1de3e81d92" label="lyrics-like">nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-a880ae99-76e0-4ec1-bf22-163ab649a20e" facs="#m-04d73165-6925-42ab-893f-f06dca793b11" label="lyrics-like">U tende:* Dómine, ad adjuván¬</l><l xml:id="m-ebaf1b1e-f430-4235-a3da-b53033a26395" facs="#m-0e81fd79-be18-4ac8-813d-65d975b1ddf0" label="lyrics-like">Numquid in aetérnum irascéris</l><l xml:id="m-47683eb1-6204-4dc0-b07c-1528ae9b5920" facs="#m-fc7433bd-8654-46c7-b763-074f360f5a87" label="ambiguous">dum me festina.</l><l xml:id="m-afee6851-b97c-4165-bc1f-9a532a9b2b6f" facs="#m-acdafe07-d86c-4bfc-9ffe-f86835f8f444" label="lyrics-like">nóbis? * aut exténdes iram túam a</l><l xml:id="m-2b406a41-9cc3-4795-8cde-e881f36ecf9d" facs="#m-6e69a86a-3ca7-41cc-8393-685b025471d4" label="lyrics-like">Confundántur et revereántur,</l><l xml:id="m-61b65940-576a-4109-b9d7-4f01a1dc30a4" facs="#m-f105dcaa-03f8-42ff-9e68-c8e8cefee745" label="lyrics-like">generatióne in generatiónem?</l><l xml:id="m-8bdffc9e-c3bf-481b-bdc5-9851a7e2f8b1" facs="#m-3e9aa06a-c637-45c6-a47c-438ce6b74c47" label="lyrics-like">qui quaérunt ánimam méam.</l><l xml:id="m-61ba32fa-3ce8-458f-88cb-2d3cd4dbfa23" facs="#m-efff02be-64bd-4efc-9363-9e400ee05aa4" label="lyrics-like">Déus, tu convérsus vivificábis</l><l xml:id="m-29461bc3-cb9a-456e-aaa0-4bf54439afd9" facs="#m-6874c5ec-6abb-4ed6-9d95-b03739a183fc" label="lyrics-like">Avertántur retrórsum et erubé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ebadfbf8-dcd7-4fc6-a183-f1b46e637f89" facs="#m-7377bcb9-70af-4779-998e-e43811664aa2" label="lyrics-like">et plebs túa laetábitur</l><l xml:id="m-b1931711-10d7-4ed9-a6da-e3f96d8ce11c" facs="#m-cc810eba-6fd1-497c-8842-f968c371fbab" label="lyrics-like">scant, * qui vólunt míhi mála.</l><l xml:id="m-70416024-ecdd-4b86-8b21-dd3a398e3215" facs="#m-622c471f-f749-4c07-87ba-62f5909cfbaf" label="ambiguous">in te.</l><l xml:id="m-2bd49bca-8d2c-43ad-b600-29a60023aca4" facs="#m-9f6fa194-0f66-49f8-b77d-09a53d7105b5" label="lyrics-like">Avertántur statim erubescén¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6b93c0f-773b-4797-8682-dfc001d10c4b" facs="#m-2f3f199f-931f-447c-b07c-7c7172d9ec93" label="lyrics-like">Osténde nóbis, Dómine, miseri¬</l><l xml:id="m-56ba8bee-fa77-4564-87c8-15edd8961e34" facs="#m-486b98a0-75db-4444-9da3-a44fccdd1eac" label="lyrics-like">tes, * qui dícunt mihi: Eúge,</l><l xml:id="m-44514c80-9f45-4e82-bbd1-5e843a14f42e" facs="#m-c17b2437-509c-4936-9e7a-938ff8b4b709" label="lyrics-like">córdiam túam :* et salutáre túum</l><l xml:id="m-7b563a4c-db81-44e6-a869-4bcd019e7cc9" facs="#m-670bde53-edad-448c-84ed-b95f63a97633" label="ambiguous">euge.</l><l xml:id="m-f6a70cf5-a10b-4853-a597-c403a35d24ae" facs="#m-5b8ca2ff-3399-4a2d-8f0c-b9948ec0b48e" label="lyrics-like">da nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-a588833b-e95e-4080-8325-0a5c7f41d174" facs="#m-2b759750-5644-42fc-bfd1-13d0ba0a2ce4" label="lyrics-like">Exsúltent et laeténtur in te ómnes</l><l xml:id="m-5c79f8b8-40e1-4901-b3ef-ec7ac6941839" facs="#m-d52688dd-1a2b-4b49-8087-3ca0be28ade6" label="lyrics-like">Audiam quid loquátur in me Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d06acd7-11d2-4a8b-84ae-52e7a0a4ddaa" facs="#m-6ecaf61a-b967-46ef-8fa2-fd9a54cd97f1" label="lyrics-like">qui quaérunt te, * et dicant semper:</l><l xml:id="m-6fc1c576-4a11-4cf6-ae6c-93f7ca1253df" facs="#m-2aa66ac8-41f0-4994-9263-ca560fb35740" label="lyrics-like">minus Deus: *quóniam loquétur</l><l xml:id="m-138b9fd5-8c52-4e88-8655-7eb13ba58625" facs="#m-dac67b08-bc53-4bd5-b46f-ecd45a6bec1b" label="lyrics-like">Magniscétur Dóminus: qui diligunt</l><l xml:id="m-58b35e05-da71-4731-a89f-9d38a0f412ed" facs="#m-a6748f91-bf33-4364-8bb2-3f817a638cff" label="lyrics-like">pácem in plébem súam.</l><l xml:id="m-c60a97b2-fc17-476f-9aff-1214eb8caec4" facs="#m-f93ab507-3a43-44f1-b103-97e0147f84aa" label="lyrics-like">salutáre tuuc.</l><l xml:id="m-3d87a98a-20ed-476e-9958-1bda51fce0e4" facs="#m-d1548323-a13c-4f58-b11b-351fb0b9756a" label="lyrics-like">Et super sánctos suos: “ et in</l><l xml:id="m-5754be15-3547-4fef-a0a9-17b6dba62dfa" facs="#m-beba0e3b-ee6c-499a-815a-ecf70c5692a5" label="lyrics-like">Egovero egénus et pauper sum:</l><l xml:id="m-8852ef91-997d-4180-ae3a-86a39bf52b06" facs="#m-346bfc10-6418-4ff6-b929-84a895eeb065" label="lyrics-like">éos qei convertúntur ad cor.</l><l xml:id="m-685fc589-e800-487b-b680-3a98132d4f74" facs="#m-33e14a64-5d19-474f-a029-275f2a7c9ea0" label="lyrics-like">Déus, ádjuvã me.</l><l xml:id="m-41217bb8-2668-4ab1-a7bb-c7b31713f595" facs="#m-e7fe53ce-9348-4d7a-87de-bb797cebc0b1" label="lyrics-like">Vérúmtamen prope timéntes éum</l><l xml:id="m-3621c667-6bc9-4518-ad05-1d66dc13e980" facs="#m-953bfa1d-0018-4397-8d27-d3cd2545d169" label="lyrics-like">Adiútor méus et liberátor méus</l><l xml:id="m-1717dfbe-dcf4-4b2b-8426-71a4e2ef7370" facs="#m-b328aa78-307e-4b65-926a-129838dcf952" label="lyrics-like">salutáre ipsius : * ut inhábitet gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-72416a10-8be5-44d3-aa1c-7b5075e9b555" facs="#m-6a82a79d-6c68-4d7c-b61b-bb542cbc2e06" label="lyrics-like">és tu :* Dómine, ne moréris.</l><l xml:id="m-898ecc66-5bef-4964-bfdf-c9583d335e54" facs="#m-b93d6a02-d8f7-4601-a05c-9a5b984791bd" label="lyrics-like">ria in térra nóstra.</l><l xml:id="m-a2c3d7ae-9a18-4958-a3ad-74a3fbc90942" facs="#m-0b1d5853-ed94-4f7f-b7cd-b8446dc61fb8" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem aeternam* dóna éts,</l><l xml:id="m-d1ba87ed-40c2-4102-ae84-2f9daf14bc43" facs="#m-545b57e0-0149-4310-8a6f-e9b22355e463" label="lyrics-like">Misericórdia et véritas obviavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-54b85cca-4e26-4d25-81e5-d357aa9c1fa9" facs="#m-c490174a-32dc-4895-8959-c4e64e4828a4" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-9f7767c6-57c0-4b4a-ae7d-cc952880872d" facs="#m-1d54a174-6576-4f87-8243-d69efc6bd335" label="lyrics-like">runt sibi :* justitia et pax osculá¬</l><l xml:id="m-29dfa3a0-abfa-46e9-a425-cb45c40832f1" facs="#m-0eaea7ee-00ed-417e-bd6a-02338e891651" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-08f5fc6c-bbb4-4032-a321-1aae8b13d1c4" facs="#m-5f131d05-b160-4736-9203-bfbd3a05f29c" label="ambiguous">tae sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-780aee3b-9131-4dc2-abbc-0eae62beb461" facs="#m-4ad872af-0dd8-4449-877c-b8cabfbe785f" label="lyrics-like">Véritas de térra órta est : * et</l><l xml:id="m-f1b76c43-345d-4963-87e2-a20a8a9d789c" facs="#m-90d894fb-22e3-4936-a407-f7bed6090eda" label="ambiguous">Psalm 84.</l><l xml:id="m-e1186ef4-fddc-45f8-8eaa-518dedf1743f" facs="#m-da20465f-ceff-4f11-a7cb-cc951e65c1d1" label="lyrics-like">justitia de caélo prospéxit.</l><l xml:id="m-709e5ac1-2aa4-4078-84c3-71847846f5ef" facs="#m-f7ea5a30-cfd4-480f-9f34-71acb394de98" label="lyrics-like">DEnedixísti, Dómine, térram</l><l xml:id="m-1d94264f-057c-4751-9b4e-b0e37df87117" facs="#m-df1b8a33-3753-4b40-bf47-f79799a6dbd9" label="lyrics-like">Etenim Dóminus dábit benigni¬</l><l xml:id="m-f17a8ed1-87ef-46db-bdd8-8e3e35be73b7" facs="#m-e340c1f7-aadd-4259-89ad-0639f42165be" label="lyrics-like">Otúam: * avertisti captivitátem</l><l xml:id="m-55633d0e-7425-4e04-b6b9-633e38f7eea5" facs="#m-f4c2a131-cc19-4a72-98a2-dd25a419f605" label="lyrics-like">tátem:“ et térra nóstra dábit</l><l xml:id="m-70631c5c-760a-434e-9008-7324560ef634" facs="#m-6f0f1ed2-0069-419b-a9e8-ff74520dab9b" label="lyrics-like">Jácob.</l><l xml:id="m-36e26d73-9543-46c3-a782-f17b0b8c80ec" facs="#m-e9c9d1d3-021f-47ea-b5c7-90f1db813890" label="lyrics-like">frúctum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-f7d53a60-5349-4caa-bfbb-56b3e30c3bca" facs="#m-91527557-1e8d-44cf-8157-2ad18c001d10" label="lyrics-like">Remisísti iniquitátem plébis</l><l xml:id="m-62258186-b3b8-4dc9-a10e-665d88f232bb" facs="#m-fecc2955-8d07-407c-b838-245cd0c125d8" label="lyrics-like">Justitia ante éum ambulábit :"</l><l xml:id="m-8088c9d5-10fa-435f-aed5-cf5a24e9ba6e" facs="#m-686f6aae-cca8-417a-9ad3-cf9dfcc68871" label="lyrics-like">túae:*operuisti ómnia peccáta</l><l xml:id="m-3637736d-eb2d-498a-af08-33b813e05814" facs="#m-a81feb3c-4274-4f2b-8efb-5666945427d0" label="lyrics-like">et pónet in vía gréssus súos.</l><l xml:id="m-bf7c163c-a966-4765-9299-c30625ba3be6" facs="#m-dceef427-685b-4f07-92e8-025f5b78d3e0" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem actérnam* dóna éts,</l><l xml:id="m-b852eb80-1e4c-4665-b563-b4e1eb36ffe8" facs="#m-fb7c1b1c-ac60-42be-898d-2e1c2b59ef1f" label="lyrics-like">córum.</l><l xml:id="m-ed6bac57-7829-4a13-9283-cbfdfc2c2353" facs="#m-071afcb1-9282-41e7-8f3d-652e6f478e12" label="lyrics-like">Mitigásti ómnem fram túam:</l><l xml:id="m-9bf34695-e26f-45b6-9cd3-40f2b0dd11e7" facs="#m-a0745a5d-8ed3-4c90-a13f-b5c130fcd233" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-544db511-9a9b-4068-8333-2b15ccfb6be0" facs="#m-5413890f-e86f-4124-ae03-c378a7460f06" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-209057ee-31b7-4a7c-8566-36d530a9a64b" facs="#m-20f24531-aff1-4ac0-a665-813715bb6eee" label="lyrics-like">avertisti ab ira indignatiónis túae.</l><l xml:id="m-552b4814-388b-494b-8aae-4624624171a0" facs="#m-0931db7b-5a86-4ee8-a51a-010b8fe8cb41" label="ambiguous">N° So1.— 88</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
